{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/Description_Gif_1.gif?t=1748030402\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stellar Raiders</strong> is a turn-based tactics roguelike where you lead a crew of space pirates, raid enemy ships, and grab as much loot as you can before making your escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Minimalist Turn-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast, minimalist turn-based combat focused on positioning and movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No randomness\u2014outcome depends on strategy, timing, and ability use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map is a small tactical puzzle: tight quarters, limited turns, and space management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Crew</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a squad of unique raiders, each with specialized movement, perks, and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and combine abilities like pushing, pulling, swapping, cloning, and teleporting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synergize unit powers to manipulate the battlefield and optimize your loot runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade Your Ship</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your crew, increase loot capacity, and discover stronger units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boost the quality and rarity of rewards by improving key ship systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover powerful artifacts with unique passive effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531610/extras/Description_Gif_2.gif?t=1748030402\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.ste